# Release signing material (S10-T1). Belt and braces: the Android-specific entries
# live in android/.gitignore, and these catch a key or password file dropped
# anywhere else in the tree. Never commit these — a leaked upload key cannot be
# un-leaked, and losing it means losing the ability to update the app on Play.
keystore.properties
*.keystore
*.jks
